OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal riders 'running out of
OL,4,Aroad' police warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FIllegal and anti-social riders on two
OL,7,Fwheels have been warned they are
OL,8,F"running out of road" by police.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police ran Operation
OL,11,FHyssop across four evenings, with
OL,12,Fofficers targeting illegal and
OL,13,Fanti-social riders on two wheels, which
OL,14,Fled to 13 arrests and 30 e-bikes and
OL,15,Fmotorcycles seized.
OL,17,FThe force said on some occasions it was
OL,18,Fnecessary to use "tactical contact" to
OL,19,Fstop people riding scooters, motor
OL,20,Fbikes and e-bikes in a way which puts
OL,21,Fother people at risk.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
