OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal riders 'running out of
OL,4,Aroad' police warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of roads policing Ch Insp Simon
OL,7,FJenkinson said the "rare" use of the
OL,8,Fapproach was being used at "very low
OL,9,Fspeed" and added: "We only really do
OL,10,Fthat when we absolutely have to and
OL,11,Fwhen it's safe".
